Tracer keeps the ScarletNX game reports that people send it on Discord: a message that
mentions it with a log attached becomes a report, its logs summarized, their home folders
shown as ~, its screenshots without their metadata. It draws them as a static site, grouped
by game, for a web server to serve, and tracer-mcp serves the reports to agents as an MCP
server. They run as the services tracer and tracer_mcp, the bot's settings in
/usr/local/etc/tracer.env.
